This plugin reuses structure and two small code patterns from
everyday-causal-skills by Robson Tigre
(https://github.com/RobsonTigre/everyday-causal-skills, commit 5317ebc):

- the package preflight snippet (detect missing packages, report, do not install),
  adapted in references/preflight.md and the templates;
- the layout of the eval case files (evals/cases/*.yaml).

