Book content: the method follows Rob J Hyndman and George Athanasopoulos,
Forecasting: Principles and Practice, 3rd edition (https://otexts.com/fpp3/) and
its Python edition (https://otexts.com/fpppy/). The book text belongs to its
authors. Nothing here copies it; the skills paraphrase its methods and link to it.

Data: the templates download datasets at run time from the R packages
tsibbledata, tsibble and fpp3 (GPL-3). No data file is redistributed here.
